msgid ""
"The following Qwen3-0.6B example has been validated on Atlas 300I DUO and "
"Atlas 200I Pro."
msgstr "以下Qwen3-0.6B示例已在Atlas 300I DUO和Atlas 200I Pro上验证通过。"

msgid "???+ important \"Runtime requirements for this hardware path\""
msgstr "???+ important \"此硬件路径的运行时要求\""

msgid ""
"- Use `float16`.\n"
"    - Use `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` and limit the graph capture sizes.\n"
"    - `enable_npugraph_ex` is not supported. Set `--additional-config '{\"ascend_compilation_config\": {\"enable_npugraph_ex\":false}}'`."
msgstr ""
"- 使用`float16`。\n"
"    - 使用`FULL_DECODE_ONLY`并限制图捕获大小。\n"
"    - 不支持`enable_npugraph_ex`。设置`--additional-config '{\"ascend_compilation_config\": {\"enable_npugraph_ex\":false}}'`。"

msgid "If you see the following logs:"
msgstr "如果您看到以下日志："

msgid "Congratulations! You have successfully started the vLLM server."
msgstr "恭喜！您已成功启动vLLM服务器。"

msgid "You can query the model list:"
msgstr "您可以查询模型列表："

msgid "You can also send a prompt to the model:"
msgstr "您还可以向模型发送提示："

msgid ""
"vLLM is running as a background process. You can use `kill -2 $VLLM_PID` to "
"stop it gracefully, which is similar to pressing `Ctrl+C` for a foreground "
"vLLM process:"
msgstr "vLLM作为后台进程运行。您可以使用`kill -2 $VLLM_PID`优雅地停止它，这类似于对前台vLLM进程按`Ctrl+C`："

msgid "???+ warning \"Confirm the process before stopping the service\""
msgstr "???+ warning \"停止服务前确认进程\""

msgid ""
"If other `vllm serve` processes are running in the current environment, "
"`pgrep -f \"vllm serve\"` may also match those vLLM services."
msgstr "如果当前环境中运行着其他`vllm serve`进程，`pgrep -f \"vllm serve\"`也可能匹配到那些vLLM服务。"

msgid ""
"Before running `kill`, confirm that `VLLM_PID` is the service started by "
"this example to avoid stopping another running vLLM process by mistake."
msgstr "在运行`kill`之前，请确认`VLLM_PID`是本示例启动的服务，以避免误停其他正在运行的vLLM进程。"

msgid "The output is as follows:"
msgstr "输出如下："

msgid "Finally, press `Ctrl+D` to exit the container."
msgstr "最后，按`Ctrl+D`退出容器。"
